## Title: Preview Anywhere
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.1.1
## APIVersion: 101050
## Description: Adds item previews to gamepad UIs that lack them: bank and Furnishing Vault withdraw lists, plus linked items in chat, mail, and guild descriptions.
